## Implementation Details

The Analytics component is correctly placed at the bottom of the main App component, which ensures:
1. It loads on every page/route in the application
2. It tracks all route changes via React Router
3. It follows Vercel's recommended best practices for React applications

## Next Steps for User

To activate Web Analytics in production:
1. Deploy the project to Vercel (if not already deployed)
2. Navigate to the project's Analytics section in the Vercel dashboard
3. Click the "Enable" button to activate Web Analytics
4. After the next deployment, analytics will start collecting data at `/_vercel/insights/*` routes

